1
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:15,039
When we granted water,
mortals grew greedy,

2
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:19,199
nearly killing Lanyuan the flood loong.

3
00:00:19,920 --> 00:00:23,440
Enraged, you unleashed
the Li Fire upon the earth,

4
00:00:24,800 --> 00:00:27,039
only for it to rage out of control,

5
00:00:27,039 --> 00:00:28,480
trapping you in the mortal realm.

6
00:00:29,199 --> 00:00:32,679
Whoever harms my kin
shall face retribution.

7
00:00:32,960 --> 00:00:35,079
To keep you safe,

8
00:00:35,079 --> 00:00:36,960
we had to seal you here.

9
00:00:38,679 --> 00:00:43,280
You may return home
when the Cloud Steps open again.

10
00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:46,359
Yet if you meet one
aligned with Kan Water,

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,640
(the seal may break,)

12
00:00:49,920 --> 00:00:52,719
and the Li Fire will rage once more.

13
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:05,949
=My Loong=

14
00:01:06,679 --> 00:01:09,024
=Episode 2=

15
00:01:31,480 --> 00:01:34,159
My wounds have healed?

16
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,439
(Is he the Loong Lord?)

17
00:01:50,239 --> 00:01:51,359
(This is the Loong Abyss?)

18
00:01:56,799 --> 00:02:00,200
(So loongs really do exist?)

19
00:02:03,480 --> 00:02:04,719
(What happened after that?)

20
00:02:31,479 --> 00:02:33,719
(The Li Fire subsided.)

21
00:02:36,319 --> 00:02:37,319
(Because of her?)

22
00:02:59,199 --> 00:03:00,199
You're badly hurt.

23
00:03:00,439 --> 00:03:01,520
What did they offer you

24
00:03:01,719 --> 00:03:02,719
to throw your life away?

25
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,360
Killing me won't get you out.

26
00:03:06,479 --> 00:03:07,639
Why don't we work together

27
00:03:08,039 --> 00:03:09,240
to get out first?

28
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,240
Die!

29
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,000
Thank you for saving me.

30
00:03:29,159 --> 00:03:30,159
Who are you?

31
00:03:32,759 --> 00:03:33,759
You're hurt?

32
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:36,039
Did that loong hurt you?

33
00:03:38,159 --> 00:03:39,319
Were you taken here too?

34
00:03:43,199 --> 00:03:44,199
Don't be afraid.

35
00:03:44,680 --> 00:03:45,960
I was taken here as a sacrifice.

36
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,520
I know some medicine.

37
00:03:48,120 --> 00:03:49,159
I can treat your wounds.

38
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,360
It's Bonewort.

39
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:09,560
It heals injuries.

40
00:04:13,400 --> 00:04:14,879
Don't worry. It's not poisonous.

41
00:04:44,279 --> 00:04:45,319
I'm Yue Wangshu.

42
00:04:46,079 --> 00:04:47,079
What's your name?

43
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:48,600
Lizhi.

44
00:04:50,360 --> 00:04:51,360
Lizhi?

45
00:04:51,879 --> 00:04:52,959
Is that your name?

46
00:04:54,079 --> 00:04:55,279
How did you get here?

47
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:58,360
Do you know how to get out?

48
00:04:59,079 --> 00:05:00,079
Until the Li Fire dies,

49
00:05:00,920 --> 00:05:02,040
one is trapped here.

50
00:05:03,360 --> 00:05:04,519
Only when it subsides

51
00:05:05,319 --> 00:05:06,319
and the Cloud Steps open

52
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,680
can one return home.

53
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:10,319
Li Fire?

54
00:05:10,759 --> 00:05:11,759
Cloud Steps?

55
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,639
What are those?

56
00:05:14,360 --> 00:05:17,560
The Li Fire seemed to subside
because of you.

57
00:05:31,600 --> 00:05:32,600
What's wrong?

58
00:05:33,199 --> 00:05:34,240
Are you hurting somewhere?

59
00:05:36,439 --> 00:05:37,439
Do you know the way out?

60
00:05:41,800 --> 00:05:43,720
No, that sound...

61
00:05:44,519 --> 00:05:46,639
Let's go. Hurry!

62
00:06:33,639 --> 00:06:36,759
You're the loong?

63
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,120
Eat.

64
00:07:09,360 --> 00:07:10,360
Go on, eat.

65
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,480
You bit me.

66
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:12,560
Weren't you hungry?

67
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:16,160
So one can eat people if they're hungry?

68
00:07:16,399 --> 00:07:17,399
Why not?

69
00:07:24,759 --> 00:07:26,480
(He doesn't think like a human at all.)

70
00:07:27,040 --> 00:07:28,120
(And that flood loong.)

71
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,839
(It acts like his guard.)

72
00:07:30,759 --> 00:07:32,360
(He's keeping me from escaping.)

73
00:07:33,120 --> 00:07:35,879
(No, I have to get out of here alive.)

74
00:07:36,439 --> 00:07:37,439
My Lord,

75
00:07:39,240 --> 00:07:40,519
please wait a moment.

76
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:47,079
Even if she can quell the Li Fire,

77
00:07:47,959 --> 00:07:54,160
mortal greed trapped you here
in the first place.

78
00:07:54,759 --> 00:07:56,959
Humans can't be trusted.

79
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,040
Don't touch her.

80
00:08:39,320 --> 00:08:40,320
You're not hungry?

81
00:08:40,360 --> 00:08:41,360
I already ate.

82
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:42,840
I'm not hungry anymore.

83
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:46,360
I was injured last night

84
00:08:50,639 --> 00:08:52,080
and failed to serve you properly.

85
00:09:01,279 --> 00:09:02,279
Do the wounds

86
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,200
hurt?

87
00:09:35,720 --> 00:09:36,720
You want to kill me?

88
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,120
Why?

89
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:39,720
Am I supposed to wait to die?

90
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,159
Or do you really think

91
00:09:41,279 --> 00:09:44,879
a human would willingly lie
with a beast?

92
00:10:34,559 --> 00:10:35,559
Stop!

93
00:11:05,159 --> 00:11:06,559
I don't know why,

94
00:11:08,159 --> 00:11:09,200
but whenever I'm hurt,

95
00:11:10,639 --> 00:11:12,720
you seem to feel the exact same pain.

96
00:11:22,720 --> 00:11:23,720
Let me go.

97
00:11:29,782 --> 00:11:34,357
♪Bridal red blankets
ninety-nine miles of frost♪

98
00:11:35,132 --> 00:11:39,629
♪She looks back,
wind and rain veiling the moon♪

99
00:11:42,868 --> 00:11:47,990
♪Beneath the abyss, golden eyes open♪

100
00:11:47,990 --> 00:11:51,329
♪A thousand-year trial
scorches the soul♪

101
00:11:51,329 --> 00:11:52,693
♪Refusing to forget♪

102
00:11:56,359 --> 00:12:01,136
♪The mortal world's rules
are cruel and absurd♪

103
00:12:01,687 --> 00:12:03,477
♪He cannot learn them♪

104
00:12:03,477 --> 00:12:06,612
♪Yet carves her name upon his heart♪

105
00:12:09,764 --> 00:12:12,088
♪One name on a wooden plaque♪

106
00:12:12,088 --> 00:12:14,451
♪Swaying high upon the branch♪

107
00:12:15,029 --> 00:12:17,693
♪Waiting for snow and wind
to speak for him♪

108
00:12:17,693 --> 00:12:19,451
♪Their days ahead are long♪
